    "page_title": "Pipelines endpoint",
    "short_description": "Create, list, and manage pipelines via the v3 REST API.",
    "body": "<h1>Pipelines endpoint {{ds:component/chip|label=v3|variant=success}}</h1>
<p>Create and manage <a href="{{cms:item/5ac66235-69dc-4092-b430-9d68837e0c76}}">pipelines</a> programmatically. Base URL: <code>https://api.godzilladocs.dev/v3</code>.</p>

{{ds:component/alert|variant=info|title=Version 3 is current|body_html=<p>v3 is the latest version of the pipelines endpoint. If you're on v2, consider upgrading for new features and improvements. <a href="#v2-docs">View the v2 documentation</a> if you're still using the previous version.</p>}}

<h2 id="create">Create a pipeline</h2>
<p><code>POST /v3/pipelines</code></p>

{{ds:component/parameter-table|rows_html=<tr><td><code>name</code></td><td>string</td><td>Yes</td><td>Human-readable pipeline name, unique per workspace.</td></tr><tr><td><code>source_connector_id</code></td><td>string</td><td>Yes</td><td>ID of the connector events are read from.</td></tr><tr><td><code>destination_connector_id</code></td><td>string</td><td>Yes</td><td>ID of the connector events are written to.</td></tr><tr><td><code>transforms</code></td><td>array</td><td>No</td><td>Ordered list of transform step definitions. Omit for a pass-through copy.</td></tr><tr><td><code>schedule</code></td><td>string</td><td>No</td><td>Cron expression. Omit for event-triggered (streaming) pipelines.</td></tr><tr><td><code>tags</code></td><td>object</td><td>No</td><td><strong>[NEW in v3]</strong> Arbitrary key-value metadata for organizing and filtering pipelines.</td></tr>}}

{{ds:component/code-block|filename=create-pipeline.sh|language=bash|code=curl -X POST https://api.godzilladocs.dev/v3/pipelines \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer $GODZILLA_API_KEY" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "name": "ingest-orders",
    "source_connector_id": "conn_pg_orders",
    "destination_connector_id": "conn_snowflake_dw",
    "tags": { "team": "analytics", "env": "prod" }
  }}}

<h2 id="list">List pipelines</h2>
<p><code>GET /v3/pipelines</code> — cursor-paginated, see <a href="{{cms:item/9203f5c8-e3c8-43f3-bf33-12a7d923def8}}">Rate limits</a> for the pagination envelope. Query parameters: <code>tag_filter</code> to find pipelines by tag.</p>

<h2 id="states">Pipeline states</h2>
<p>Returned pipelines include a <code>state</code> field of <code>draft</code>, <code>active</code>, or <code>paused</code> — see <a href="{{cms:item/5ac66235-69dc-4092-b430-9d68837e0c76}}">Pipelines</a> for what each means.</p>

{{ds:component/alert|variant=danger|title=Deleting a pipeline|body_html=<p>Deleting a pipeline does not delete its source or destination connectors, and does not delete events already written to the destination. In-flight runs are allowed to finish before deletion completes.</p>}}

{{ds:component/docs-toc|items_html=<li><a href="#create">Create a pipeline</a></li><li><a href="#list">List pipelines</a></li><li><a href="#states">Pipeline states</a></li>}}",
