    "page_title": "Events endpoint",
    "short_description": "Query and replay events that have flowed through a pipeline via the v3 REST API.",
    "body": "<h1>Events endpoint {{ds:component/chip|label=v3|variant=primary}}</h1>
<p>Query and replay <a href="{{cms:item/6277e4fb-3e99-45b0-a7f6-aefe69c5778f}}">events</a> that have flowed through a pipeline.</p>

<h2 id="list">List events</h2>
<p><code>GET /v3/pipelines/{pipeline_id}/events</code> — cursor-paginated, filterable by <code>type</code>, <code>status</code>, and <code>occurred_at</code> range. v3 adds status filtering for better event lifecycle visibility.</p>

{{ds:component/parameter-table|rows_html=<tr><td><code>type</code></td><td>string</td><td>No</td><td>Filter to a single event type, e.g. <code>order.created</code>.</td></tr><tr><td><code>status</code></td><td>string</td><td>No</td><td>Filter by event status: <code>success</code>, <code>failed</code>, <code>pending</code>.</td></tr><tr><td><code>since</code></td><td>string</td><td>No</td><td>ISO-8601 timestamp lower bound on <code>occurred_at</code>.</td></tr><tr><td><code>cursor</code></td><td>string</td><td>No</td><td>Opaque pagination cursor from a previous response's <code>next_cursor</code>.</td></tr>}}

{{ds:component/code-block|filename=event.json|language=json|code={\n  "id": "evt_8f2c1a90",\n  "type": "order.created",\n  "status": "success",\n  "occurred_at": "2026-08-18T09:12:44Z",\n  "processed_at": "2026-08-18T09:12:45Z",\n  "payload": { "order_id": "ord_4471" }\n}}}

<h2 id="replay">Replay an event</h2>
<p><code>POST /v3/events/{id}/replay</code> — re-runs an event that failed or exhausted retries. v3 allows selective replays for any event, not just dead-lettered ones, with automatic retry logic.</p>

{{ds:component/alert|variant=info|title=Platform events|body_html=<p>Lifecycle notifications like <code>pipeline.started</code> and <code>connector.error</code> are not returned by this endpoint — subscribe to them through the Webhooks endpoint instead.</p>}}

{{ds:component/alert|variant=warning|title=Migrating from v2?|body_html=<p>v2 is no longer supported. See the <a href="{{cms:item/2f455353-895f-4a61-84bd-b5be7ccfd6fb}}">v2 → v3 migration guide</a> for breaking changes and upgrade steps.</p>}}

{{ds:component/docs-toc|items_html=<li><a href="#list">List events</a></li><li><a href="#replay">Replay an event</a></li>}}",
